WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.080
<i>Go, Takuto.</i>

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:08.570
<i>You carried such anguish and pain, 
such hopes to make it this far.</i>

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>I'm racing to repay all the people</i>

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.830
<i>who called me the ace!</i>

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.300
He's huge!

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.790
He's fast!

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.750
<i>I am strong!</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.150
I'm catching up!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.370
I'm catching up to the guys in front!

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.470
Switch with me, Takuto!

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.810
Hakone Academy's Kuroda moved to the front!

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.850
Go, Kuroda!

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.570
I'll show you how I pull!

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.370
This is Hakone Academy's final effort!

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.520
Bend, Cat Legs!

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:50.400
The leaders have crossed the 400 meter line!

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.930
Sohoku's Naruko is in front!

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>He refuses to let me have it.</i>

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.690
Then I don't have a choice.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:05.160
I'll have to fly before the finish line!

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:08.290
The others have crossed the 400-meter line!

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:10.570
Go, Hakone Academy!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.490
<i>We're chasing as fast as we can,
but they're going at top speed, too.</i>

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.800
<i>It's not that easy to close this gap.</i>

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.430
But! But!

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.770
It's not easy, but...

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:26.690
There's nothing I can't do!

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.510
Just 300 meters remaining!

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.240
They're closing the gap!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.820
Will they stay ahead? Will they catch up?

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.650
<i>I already said they can't catch up.</i>

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:48.540
<i>Actually, if the course were straight, 
they might have.</i>

00:01:54.250 --> 00:02:02.470
<i>But there's a difficult corner leading 
the course from National Route 120</i>

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.850
<i>to the first day's finish line 
at the large parking lot.</i>

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:07.560
<i>Two of them.</i>

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.980
<i>I'm entering the corner first!</i>

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.360
<i>I can see it.</i>

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.460
<i>It's the finish line gate!</i>

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.990
Time to fly.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.290
When insects have oversaturated an area...

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:37.840
They metamorphosize wings,
so they can fly to new locations!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:43.980
<i>We're in the middle of a corner, Midousuji!</i>

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.140
<i>You're going to do that here?</i>

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.740
They entered the corner ahead of us!

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.060
Shut up and follow me, Takuto!

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.870
<i>I'm glad there are two corners 
before the finish line.</i>

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.320
Takuto! You were right!

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:04.070
Hakone Academy has nothing left to lose!

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.040
We're charging in at full speed!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.700
Yeah!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:10.130
I'll show you...

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.290
My super-close cornering!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.640
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.720
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:48.360
The two leaders are rounding the corner!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:50.600
<i>LINE.05 3 Seconds Less</i>

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.490
Kyoto Fushimi!

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:50.640
Sohoku!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.950
There are 250 meters to the finish line!

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:56.100
Sohoku's Naruko is cornering so sharply!

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:58.900
He just hit the wall!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.850
He's standing and pedaling as hard as he can!

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:02.150
His form is beautiful!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.780
Kyoto Fushimi's right behind him!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.740
What is that?

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:11.400
His back is perfectly straight!

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:22.100
Huh?

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:25.340
On his back...

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.590
He had insect-like wings!

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:36.780
They're neck and neck!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:37.850
He's so fast!

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.070
<i>It's his "Flying Ride!"</i>

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:44.990
<i>This is really fast.</i>

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.780
<i>I know it well.</i>

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:51.030
<i>It made my nose bleed!</i>

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.290
<i>It's fast, but...</i>

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.300
<i>The same situation, the same opponent...</i>

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.810
<i>And now we're at the 
Inter-High's finish line.</i>

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:05.420
<i>If I lose now, I'm not a real man!</i>

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:12.000
I'm the flashiest man in Naniwa,
 Naruko Shoukichi!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.560
Sohoku moved ahead!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.020
He's riding on determination!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.650
Kyoto Fushimi's keeping up!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.760
Where are you going, Naruko?

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:28.180
Naru-Naru-Naru-Naruko!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:32.600
Do you have another special 
technique to use? Buzz.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.710
Sorry, but no.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.990
But I've trained.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.040
Ever since I lost to you, I've trained!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:46.100
For this day, I honed my body!

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:51.930
The finish line sprint I'm about 
to show you is common enough.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.890
Buzz, buzz...

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:59.800
Sway your bike, put your weight on it,
 and give everything you've got.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:02.230
There's nothing special about it.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.260
Buzz...

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:03.860
But!

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:09.190
It's the sprint being done by this body, 
which I've honed to perfection!

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.900
Buzz!

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.410
Watch closely.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:17.870
In the second half of this finish line sprint,
 I'll get even faster...

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.120
Like a roller coaster!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.300
Huh?

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:26.390
So you do have one! Buzz!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.570
The two leaders are 
entering the final corner!

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:30.970
One they clear this...

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.260
It's the finish line!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:38.100
<i>One hundred and fifty meters left!</i>

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.230
Hakone Academy's cornering is crazy!

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.770
His shoulder scraped against the wall!

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:50.780
Huh? Blood?

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.570
<i>We shaved off half a second on that corner!</i>

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.490
<i>My shoulder's cut and bleeding?</i>

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.790
<i>That doesn't matter!</i>

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>I'll catch up!</i>

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.000
<i>I'll catch up to them!</i>

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.610
<i>I have to!</i>

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:07.750
<i>I'll shave off half a second 
on the next corner!</i>

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:12.820
<i>No, more! I can do it!</i>

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.000
<i>Yuki-chan...</i>

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:19.310
<i>I know how you're feeling.</i>

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.460
<i>It's giving me chills.</i>

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.050
<i>I'm about to cry.</i>

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:25.310
<i>But I won't!</i>

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:31.940
<i>Because I'm wearing #1!</i>

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:35.450
I am strong!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.980
Takuto! Once we're out of 
the final corner, move up!

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:39.950
We'll shave off two seconds!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:44.620
Then I'll push your back 
to shave off one more!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.130
The rest is up to you.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:52.530
The deliveryman's job ends there.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:54.630
Don't look back, Takuto.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:03.060
The others have entered the final corner!

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.190
They're charging in at that speed?

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.440
<i>We'll do it! I know we can!</i>

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:13.240
<i>We have to shave off three 
seconds to catch up!</i>

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.050
His shoulder's hitting the wall!

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.200
<i>More...</i>

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.210
<i>More!</i>

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.910
<i>You can shave off more...</i>

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:29.770
<i>Kuroda Yukinari!</i>

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.670
<i>Don't go wild!</i>

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.880
<i>We're almost there.</i>

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.380
<i>One second!</i>

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.010
His helmet's hitting the wall!

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.720
<i>Two seconds!</i>

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.480
<i>Crap!</i>

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:51.460
<i>Before I could think,
 my body reacted instinctively.</i>

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:57.170
<i>If we keep moving as a group,
 we'll be in danger.</i>

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.450
Now! Go, Takuto!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:09.960
Take the last second with you, Takuto!

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:13.920
<i>Three seconds!</i>

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.090
Shake them off!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.340
Hakone Academy's ace is going!

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.460
He fell!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.010
<i>I did it.</i>

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:40.010
<i>Now go, Takuto.</i>

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.660
<i>Don't look back.</i>

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:50.290
<i>I'd never look back, Yuki-chan.</i>

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:55.210
<i>You... You pushed my back.</i>

00:10:55.830 --> 00:11:00.880
<i>And I... I know what I have to do!</i>

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.690
It's 100 meters to the finish line!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:08.140
Hakone Academy caught up to the 
front in the eleventh hour!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.950
<i>Caught up?</i>

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.880
<i>You seem desperate, Wobbly Academy.</i>

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:16.560
<i>Wobbly caught up?</i>

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.650
<i>Watch closely, you blind fans.</i>

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:24.320
<i>He's still three meters behind!</i>

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.770
There's 80 meters left!

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:29.200
<i>I will...</i>

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.220
Wobbly!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:33.960
<i>...stay ahead and win!</i>

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:37.590
<i>Hakone Academy? There's more of them.</i>

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:42.590
<i>More fans behind me to watch
 just how amazing I am!</i>

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.680
Sohoku's accelerating!

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.290
What a sprint!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.100
There's 70 meters left!

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.600
<i>I can see the finish line!</i>

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.860
<i>Here I come!</i>

00:11:55.860 --> 00:12:02.200
<i>I call it the Naruko Special 
Roller Coaster Sprint!</i>

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.280
He's fast!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.700
He's accelerating like a roller coaster!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.870
<i>I'll definitely win!</i>

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.990
Midousuji... Naruko...

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:21.130
I've never lost a sprint from here.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.540
They're all sprinting for the finish!

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.640
There's 60 meters left!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.050
Go, Kyoto Fushimi!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.440
Sohoku!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.250
Hakone Academy!

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.690
There's 60 meters to the finish line!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.200
<b>Hakone Academy</b>

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.210
Ashikiba-san!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:54.000
<b>Kyoto Fushimi</b>

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:54.000
Midousuji-san!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.750
<b>Sohoku</b>

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.000
Naruko-san!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:02.760
Let me reach the finish line!

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:07.510
Kyoto Fushimi, Sohoku, and
 Hakone Academy are all-out sprinting!

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.360
The finish line's gate is 
right before their eyes!

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:16.750
Guh-ross!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.900
Mine!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:22.360
Mine, mine, mine, mine!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:26.570
Move, move, move, move!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.660
Mine!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.490
You pests!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.370
Mine!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:39.610
<i>I want only victory!</i>

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.160
#111 is so gross!

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:44.840
No way!

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.780
<i>I don't need anything else!</i>

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:52.140
Mine!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.450
Win!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.130
<i>I'll win!</i>

00:13:55.130 --> 00:14:00.480
<i>Win, win, win, win!</i>

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:08.450
<i>I crawled back up from the 
ground for this very moment!</i>

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.790
<i>I threw away what was most important 
to me and made it this far!</i>

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:29.430
<i>My arms are numb?</i>

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.760
<i>My muscles are screaming?</i>

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.260
<i>So what?</i>

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.560
<i>I'll roll them up...</i>

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:40.400
<i>...like takoyaki and eat them!</i>

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.630
<i>Watch this, fans!</i>

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:44.440
<i>Onoda-kun!</i>

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.070
<i>You, too, hotshot!</i>

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:51.250
<i>This is how a flashy man lives!</i>

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.740
Sohoku caught up to Kyoto Fushimi!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.330
Mine?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.830
I told you!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.770
It gets faster in the second half!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.250
Roller mine?

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.430
Thirty meters left!

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:08.560
So fast!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.380
How fast are they going?

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:15.060
<i>I'll win it, Yuki-chan!</i>

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.760
Third? He just barely can't catch up?

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.890
Ashikiba-san, after them!

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:25.900
<i>I should be exhausted, but my body</i>

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:29.830
<i>is full of strength!</i>

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.490
<i>We have nothing left to lose!</i>

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.060
<i>I am strong.</i>

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:39.020
<i>I am strong.</i>

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.580
<i>I am strong!</i>

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.830
<i>I am strong!</i>

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:46.590
<i>I am strong!</i>

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.260
Hakone Academy's ace's sprint is amazing!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:52.010
His huge body is accelerating rapidly!

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:54.640
Hakone Academy's catching up!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.180
He's nearly caught them!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.740
I am strong!

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.600
Win!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.190
Mine!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.690
Excuse me!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.270
Let us through!

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:09.230
What's going on?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:12.610
There are three of them, neck and neck!

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:27.590
The finish line!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.500
There are 20 meters left!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.690
Ashikiba-san!

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:34.090
Pedal!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.560
Now 10 meters!

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.810
Midousuji-san!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.680
Go!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.690
Mine!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:49.140
Naruko-san!

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:52.940
Fight!

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.160
Take it, Naruko!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.910
Win!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.420
Go!

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:11.500
Victory!

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:14.380
I am strong!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.480
Victory!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.280
Win!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:19.850
I am strong!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:41.490
<i>The finish line of the 
first day of the Inter-High...</i>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:55.190
<i>...is claimed by Hakone 
Academy's Ashikiba Takuto!</i>

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:21.930
He barely won!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.760
Hakone Academy is amazing!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.020
There it is!

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.380
He's raising both of his arms in victory!

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:30.980
The strongest wings ever,
 which signal Hakone Academy's supremacy!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:32.850
<i>In second place...</i>

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.980
What an idiot. Second place...

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:44.490
...is meaningless.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.080
<b>Headquarters</b>

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:49.080
This is...

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:51.090
I've never seen this before.

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:54.710
This year's race might be 
as wild as last year's.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.210
<b>Place</b>

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.210
<b>Rider</b>

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.210
<b>Ashikiba Takuto</b>

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.640
<i>Second place is a tie!</i>

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:05.930
<i>Chiba Sohoku's Naruko Shoukichi and 
Kyoto Fushimi's Midousuji Akira!</i>

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.030
Naruko-san!

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.430
Naruko!

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:13.190
Damn, damn, damn!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:19.010
Damn it!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:23.510
I'm an idiot! An idiot!

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:27.540
Damn it!

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:29.480
<i>In one of the Inter-High's
 three battles for the finish line,</i>

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:31.210
<i>he finished a close second.</i>

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.230
<i>I can't imagine how frustrating that is.</i>

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:40.380
<i>In fourth place is Chiba Sohoku's
 Imaizumi Shunsuke.</i>

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:43.130
<i>Naruko.</i>

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:47.970
G-Good work.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:03.620
Mine!

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:06.520
Hey, are you okay?

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:08.530
Hey, you! Hey!

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:13.220
You did it, Takuto.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:21.300
<i>The winner is Hakone Academy's #11, 
third-year and ace Ashikiba Takuto!</i>

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.870
Good job!

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:26.500
Good job!

